1
00:00:00,453 --> 00:00:05,544
Jab na samay tha... na aakash. Na dharti thi, na jeevan.
Na koi disha... na koi seema.

2
00:00:05,544 --> 00:00:09,544
Tab kya tha? Kya sach mein kuch bhi nahi tha?

3
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:14,951
Hindu Puranic parampara mein, us anant jalrashi ke beech tha Ksheer Sagar...

4
00:00:14,951 --> 00:00:19,552
Jahan anant Sheshnag par yog-nidra mein virajmaan the Bhagwan Vishnu.

5
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,663
Woh the Narayan... anant, shaant aur samay se pare.

6
00:00:24,663 --> 00:00:30,550
Unki yog-nidra mein bhi chhupi thi ek aisi sambhavna...
jo aage chalkar poori srishti ka aadhar bani.

7
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:36,409
Phir ek divya kamal prakat hua...
Narayan ki nabhi se nikalta hua, anant jal ke upar uthta hua.

8
00:00:36,409 --> 00:00:40,549
Jaise shunyata ke beech janm le rahi ho... ek nayi sambhavna.

9
00:00:41,403 --> 00:00:46,157
Aur us kamal par prakat hue Brahma...
chaar mukhon wale srishti ke rachayita.

10
00:00:46,157 --> 00:00:50,545
Unke saamne tha ek anant prashn... aur ek anant zimmedari.

11
00:00:51,351 --> 00:00:56,409
Lekin Brahma ke mann mein sawal utha... Main kaun hoon?
Mujhe kisne janm diya?

12
00:00:56,409 --> 00:01:00,547
Aur meri utpatti ka rahasya kya hai?
Unhone uska uttar khojna shuru kiya.

13
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:07,667
Puranic varnan ke anusaar, Brahma ne srishti ki rachna aarambh ki...
lokon, prakriti aur jeevan ke anek roopon ka vistaar hone laga.

14
00:01:07,667 --> 00:01:11,508
Andhkaar mein ab roshni thi.

15
00:01:12,395 --> 00:01:17,293
Unse prakat hui rishiyon aur Prajapatiyon ki parampara...
aur srishti ki kahani aage badhne lagi.

16
00:01:17,293 --> 00:01:21,465
Gyaan, jeevan aur chetna ke anek roop saamne aaye.

17
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:25,800
Aur yahi hai srishti, sthiti aur pralaya ka anant chakra...

18
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:29,645
Kyunki Hindu darshan mein creation sirf ek shuruaat nahi...
ek anant yatra hai.
